  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">오늘 구름만들기 실험을 하였습니다. 모두들 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">신나게 참여하였고요.</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"> 사진도 몇 장 찍었습니다.^^</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">오랜 만에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학년 수업을 하였더니</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그새 이런 장치가 나왔네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">액정 온도계로 온도 변화 관찰을 수월하게 할 수 있고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실험결과도 잘 나옵니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. <br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9924F0345B1F3D042B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"기존구름장치(1).jpg\"  id=\"A_9924F0345B1F3D042B5584\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예전에 했던 둥근바닥 플라스크(고무마개에 주사기 연결)를 다시 활용해 보았습니다.<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996F7B405B1F3D300E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"둥근바닥 플라스크.jpg\"  id=\"A_996F7B405B1F3D300E9E22\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이런 방법도 있습니다. 페트병을 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">손으로 꽉 잡았다 놓았다하는 과정을</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"> 은근히</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> 재미있어 합니다. 압축하는 친구의 손가락이 빨개졌지요?&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994E663A5B1F3D8C0B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"페트병 압축.jpg\"  id=\"A_994E663A5B1F3D8C0B253E\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9989BC335B1F3DA037\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"페트병 팽창.jpg\"  id=\"A_9989BC335B1F3DA037EDC4\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">더 재미있는 방법이 없을까 고민하다가 줄을 두 가닥으로 연결한 실험장치를 고안해 보았습니다(투명호스, 플라스틱 Y자관, 연결고무관 필요).</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">두 명이 동시에 피스톤 압축</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">팽창 과정을 반복하는데 팀워크가 중요합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">마음이 잘 맞으면 다른 장치보다 훨씬 선명한 결과를 얻을 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.(마지막 사진은 어색한 순간에 포착되었네요. 원래는 자연스런 동작이 가능합니다.)&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990D48345B1F3E1702\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"개발한 구름장치(1).jpg\"  id=\"A_990D48345B1F3E17020926\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9905C8385B1F3E2833\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"개발한 구름장치(2).jpg\"  id=\"A_9905C8385B1F3E28335E64\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></s